mal, Survival, and Free Roam</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch fish, insects, and other creatures to eat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink water from lakes and streams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage for mushrooms, berries, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build shelters to store your items and sleep in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire Bigfoot Skills like Bigfoot Vision, Speed, Portals, and Strength. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Bigfoot Healing to heal injured animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove yourself as guardian of the forest and unlock special rewards through challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human Bigfoot Hunters that try to photograph you and prove your existence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal human items for more points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather, experience the forest in all seasons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become friends with a human.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and interact with other Bigfoot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and eventually find and attract a mate for Bigfoot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time of  Day, Weather, and Changing Seasons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108130/extras/d517e0500f66c87ae3d0130845f8ed49.poster.avif?t=1761007785\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108130/extras/d517e0500f66c87ae3d0130845f8ed49.webm?t=1761007785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108130/extras/d517e0500f66c87ae3d0130845f8ed49.mp4?t=1761007785\" type=\"video/m